{
  "Name": "AwingSoft Winds3D Player SceneURL Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a data segment buffer overflow within Winds3D Viewer of AwingSoft Awakening 3.x (WindsPly.ocx v3.6.0.0). This ActiveX is a plugin of AwingSoft Web3D Player. By setting an overly long value to the 'SceneURL' property, an attacker can overrun a buffer and execute arbitrary code.",
